{"type":"message","id":"f5170e12","parentId":"30818353","timestamp":"2026-05-19T16:50:14.265Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued user message that arrived while the previous turn was still active]\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ffd784e14a8ee871ade1db81a8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 16:44 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ffd784e14a8ee871ade1db81a8]\nou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 我要做skill runtime\n\n[Tue 2026-05-19 16:49 UTC] [System] Your previous turn was interrupted by a gateway restart while OpenClaw was waiting on tool/model work. Continue from the existing transcript and finish the interrupted response."}],"timestamp":1779209414254}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c25e08d","parentId":"f5170e12","timestamp":"2026-05-19T16:52:04.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they want to build a \"skill runtime\" - this changes the context significantly from just \"building a minimal TDX system\" to building a runtime environment for skills using TDX. This is directly related to their strategic focus areas from USER.md:\n- Agent能力（Skill）资产化\n- ECHO资产协议与OpenClaw Agent结合\n- 建立使用权经济的分布网络\n\nSo the user wants to use TDX as the trusted execution environment to run skills (AI agent capabilities) in a secure, confidential computing environment. This is a much more specific and strategic request than just a general TDX exploration.\n\nLet me think about what a \"Skill Runtime\" in the context of TDX would mean:\n\n1. Skills are agent capabilities (from OpenClaw's ecosystem)\n2. TDX provides hardware-level isolation for executing these skills\n3. This enables \"Skill as a Service\" - skills can be executed in a trusted environment where:\n   - The skill provider's code/IP is protected\n   - The user's data is protected\n   - Execution integrity is verifiable via attestation\n\nThis is essentially building a confidential computing runtime for AI agent skills, which is a perfect fit for their ECHO asset protocol and the \"使用权经济分布网络\" (usage-rights economy distribution network).\n\nLet me provide a more targeted response now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了，主公的目标不是泛泛的 TDX 实验，而是**用 TDX 构建 Skill 运行时（Runtime）**。这直接关联到您的战略核心——**Agent 能力资产化 + 使用权经济的分布式执行网络**。\n\n让我重新推演。\n\n---\n\n## 战略定位：Skill Runtime on TDX\n\n本质上是：**以 TDX 作为硬件信任根，构建一个可验证、可隔离、可远程证明的 Skill 执行沙箱。**\n\n```\nSkill Provider ──▶ Skill Runtime (TDX) ◀── Skill Consumer\n    ↑                    ↓                        ↑\n  代码/IP保护        远程证明 Quote           数据隐私保护\n```\n\n---\n\n## 核心架构推演\n\n### 这个 Runtime 需要什么？\n\n| 层 | 组件 | TDX 的作用 |\n|----|------|-----------|\n| **执行层** | Skill 运行沙箱（容器/VM） | TD 隔离，Host 不可见 |\n| **调度层** | Runtime 管理面（创建/销毁 TD） | 每个 Skill 实例一个 TD |\n| **证明层** | Attestation Service | 验证 TD 身份和代码完整性 |\n| **数据层** | 加密输入/输出 | 仅 TD 内解密，Host 不可见 |\n| **资产层** | Skill Licensing / Token 验证 | 验证使用权的有效性 |\n\n---\n\n## 三条实现路径\n\n### ⚡ 路径一：基于 td-shim + 微内核（推荐起步）\n\n```\n最小系统：\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│  Skill Runtime              │\n│  ┌─────────────────────┐    │\n│  │  Rust 微内核 + WASM  │    │ ← 最小可信计算基（TCB）\n│  │  Runtime            │    │\n│  └─────────────────────┘    │\n│  ┌─────────────────────┐    │\n│  │  td-shim (启动固件)   │    │ ← TDX 入口\n│  └─────────────────────┘    │\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**适合场景**：Skill 是 WASM 模块或轻量级代码片段\n**优点**：TCB 极小，容易证明，资源开销低\n**挑战**：需要自己构建 Guest 内核和 Runtime\n\n**搭建步骤：**\n\n```\n1. 准备 TDX 主机（云实例或自有硬件）\n2. 构建最小 Guest 内核：\n   - Linux kernel 6.2+ minimal config\n   - 只保留运行 WASM Runtime 所需的内核模块\n3. 集成 WASM Runtime（wasmtime / wasmer）作为 Skill 执行引擎\n4. 用 td-shim 打包成 TD 镜像\n5. 启动 TD，验证隔离\n6. 添加 Attestation：\n   - 获取 TD Quote\n   - 验证 Quote 中的 MRTD（度量寄存器）= 期望的 Runtime 哈希\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 路径二：基于 Confidential Containers（中级）\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│  CoCo (Confidential Containers)  │\n│  ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐  │\n│  │ Skill A  │ │ Skill B  │  │ ← 容器\n│  └──────────┘ └──────────┘  │\n│  ┌─────────────────────┐    │\n│  │  Kata Agent (Guest)  │    │ ← 容器管理\n│  └─────────────────────┘    │\n│  ┌─────────────────────┐    │\n│  │  TDVF + 完整 Linux   │    │ ← Guest OS\n│  └─────────────────────┘    │\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**适合场景**：已有容器化 Skill，希望快速接入 TDX\n**优点**：生态成熟，OCI 兼容，Kubernetes 集成\n**挑战**：TCB 较大（完整内核 + Guest OS），证明较复杂\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 路径三：自研极简 TDX Skill Runtime（长期目标）\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│            TDX Skill Runtime             │\n│  ┌────────────────────────────────┐      │\n│  │  Skill Scheduler               │      │ ← 管理 TD 生命周期\n│  │  ├─ TD 池管理                  │      │\n│  │  └─ Skill → TD 映射            │      │\n│  ├────────────────────────────────┤      │\n│  │  Attestation Gateway           │      │ ← 远程证明入口\n│  │  ├─ Quote 验证                 │      │\n│  │  └─ 策略引擎（谁可执行什么 Skill）│      │\n│  ├────────────────────────────────┤      │\n│  │  Policy Engine                 │      │ ← 使用权验证\n│  │  ├─ Token / NFT 验证           │      │\n│  │  └─ 计费/用量追踪               │      │\n│  └────────────────────────────────┘      │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n         ↑           ↑           ↑\n     Skill提供者   用户      ECHO协议层\n```\n\n---\n\n## 当前建议：三步走战略\n\n### Phase 1（1-2 周）：验证 TDX 基本能力\n- 上云起一台 TDX 实例\n- 跑通 `td-shim` 最小 TD\n- 验证隔离性（Host 不可读 Guest 内存）\n- **产出**：确认 TDX 是否满足 Skill 隔离需求\n\n### Phase 2（2-4 周）：构建最小 Skill 执行沙箱\n- 选择 WASM Runtime 作为 Skill 执行引擎\n- 打包成 TD 镜像\n- 实现 Skill 输入/输出的加密通道\n- **产出**：可在 TD 内执行一个简单 Skill（如数据处理、推理）\n\n### Phase 3（1-2 月）：集成证明 + 使用权控制\n- 集成 Intel Attestation Service\n- 构建 Quote 验证服务\n- 连接 ECHO 协议层（验证使用权的 Token/NFT）\n- **产出**：完整的 Skill 即服务闭环\n\n---\n\n## 主公，关键决策点\n\n要给出更精确的实施方案，还需要您明确：\n\n1. **Skill Runtime 的\"Skill\"是什么形态？**\n   - WASM 模块？（推荐，TCB 最小）\n   - Python 脚本？（生态丰富，但 TCB 大）\n   - 任意容器？（最灵活，但最复杂）\n\n2. **Skill 的执行模型？**\n   - 短生命周期（每次调用新建 TD）→ 冷启动延迟重要\n   - 长生命周期（常驻 TD 池）→ 资源复用重要\n\n3. **是否已有 ECHO 协议的具体设计？**\n   - 使用权验证的逻辑需要与 Runtime 紧密集成\n\n您定了方向，我就可以出 Phase 1 的具体部署脚本。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779209414266,"responseId":"7eded8de23b7459fba3fbd0f0f1b6a28"}}
